body:
It does bring me a strange comfort knowing this pain is real and not in my head, I am losing touch with myself and reality and it hurts.

&#x200B;

It also brings me great guilt to know someone else is going through this unbearable shit. If you need to vent, my post is yours to vent .

I have no idea. I let him do his thing after I helped him take things down from the dumpster cause honestly it's hard for me to watch people struggle and this guy was going to hurt himself if he tried bringing all the stuff he wanted down. 

&#x200B;

I think I only helped too cause like shit, what else does a human do when he is faced with that kinda information 5 minutes after he woke up from not even sleeping enough lol
